'''Thunderblood Greatsword''' is a version of [[Nord Greatsword]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[slash]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

An upgraded Nord Greatsword will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Greatsword.

